# Baked into the Vercel build. Committed on purpose: this is a public URL, not a
# secret, and it means a fresh `vercel --prod` works with no dashboard setup.
#
# A real environment variable set in the Vercel dashboard OVERRIDES this file,
# so pointing a preview at a different room server needs no code change.
VITE_SERVER_URL=https://gametest-production-4b16.up.railway.app
